        "It is recommended to use q6 or q8 quantized models, as models with lower quantization yield poor quality.\n\n<https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged>\n\n<https://huggingface.co/jayn7/HunyuanVideo-1.5_T2V_480p-GGUF>\n\n<https://huggingface.co/jayn7/HunyuanVideo-1.5_I2V_480p-GGUF>\n\n<https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-GGUF>\n\n<https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/Qwen-Image-Edit-GGUF/blob/main/mmproj/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-mmproj-BF16.gguf>\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI\n├── 📂 models\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models\n│   │      ├── hunyuanvideo1.5_480p_t2v-Q8_0.gguf\n│   │      ├── hunyuanvideo1.5_480p_i2v-Q8_0.gguf\n│   ├── 📂 loras\n│   │      ├── hunyuanvideo1.5_t2v_480p_lightx2v_4step_lora_rank_32_bf16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders\n│   │      ├── byt5_small_glyphxl_fp16.safetensors\n│   │      └── Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf\n│   │      └── Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-mmproj-BF16.gguf\n│   └── 📂 vae\n│          └── hunyuanvideo15_vae_fp16.safetensors\n```"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        902.5658750101251,
